--{ ref: 2d5c4b3a-e861-4ef2-b005-0dc668f9c33d }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-816d-a49f-e9a92f7d61e5, is_toggleable: true }}
### Example: Compare two candidates
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-816e-8f9d-c807b4213ae5 }}
  **When to use:** Choosing between proposals, or measuring how far a candidate sits from today.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-816e-8f9d-c807b4213ae5 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-814f-9a4e-d5d768f77946 }}
  **Entry point:** `strata diff`
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-814f-9a4e-d5d768f77946 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81a9-aaec-ed72356df6f5 }}
  **Outcome:** A grouped move list plus the variation-of-information distance between the two structures.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81a9-aaec-ed72356df6f5 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c3-8e7a-e6b4b6a26718 }}
  **Command & expected output:**
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c3-8e7a-e6b4b6a26718 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-9459-e863f28cdbbe }}
  ```bash
  $ strata diff --input result.json current anchored/1
  vi distance: 0.41

  moves (12 groups, 87 symbols):
    split  packages/data/blob.ts (612 sloc) -> blob/{reader,writer,meta}.ts
           reason: over cap; min-weight topological cut (3 internal edges cut, w=1.9)
    move   parse_header: codec.ts -> reader.ts
           reason: sole consumer lives in reader.ts; visibility narrows to file
    merge  utils/strings.ts + utils/text.ts -> text.ts (201 sloc)
           reason: naming cohesion 0.83; combined size under cap
  $ echo $?
  0
  ```
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-9459-e863f28cdbbe }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b9-b96d-eddeb38bd468 }}
  **Errors to expect:** `CandidateNotFound` → check mode/index reference syntax (`anchored/1`, `current`).
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b9-b96d-eddeb38bd468 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81f7-93eb-f548e1a6a78f }}
  **Notes:** Spec files moved by test projection are narrated with their subject ("follows [record.rs](http://record.rs/)").
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81f7-93eb-f548e1a6a78f }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-816d-a49f-e9a92f7d61e5 }--

