{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e9-873e-cfae95cd5381 }}
## 🏗️ Architecture Overview
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81e9-873e-cfae95cd5381 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-9535-f5130f114bd9 }}
A strict one-way crate graph mirrors the tool's own philosophy: the contract crate `ir` sits at the bottom; the pure solver `core` and the three language adapters depend only on `ir`; `engine` is the sole crate that sees both sides — and doubles as the **public library crate** (`strata-engine`) for programmatic consumers; `cli` is a thin shell over `engine`.
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8169-9535-f5130f114bd9 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8121-a8a9-fba67c888192, is_toggleable: true }}
### Interaction Diagram
  {{ ref: 3369eaad-b216-403f-9f85-13a31fb17bb7 }}
  ```mermaid
  graph TB
      subgraph Input
          SRC["source files (ts · rust · py)"]
          CFG["strata.toml"]
      end
      subgraph Consumers["Consumer Layer"]
          CLI["cli (clap)"]
          LIB["library consumers (cargo dependency)"]
      end
      subgraph Orchestration
          ENG["engine"]
      end
      subgraph Adapters["Adapter Layer"]
          TS["adapter-typescript (swc)"]
          RS["adapter-rust (syn + ra_ap)"]
          PY["adapter-python (rustpython)"]
      end
      subgraph Solver
          CORE["core (condense · shatter · layer · cluster · pack · project · diversify)"]
      end
      subgraph Contract
          IR["ir (typed graph + laminar tree + blake3 snapshot)"]
      end
      subgraph Output
          OUT["AnalyzeResult json · tree · diff · report"]
      end
      CLI -->|"invokes analysis"| ENG
      LIB -->|"calls analyze()"| ENG
      CFG -->|"configures"| ENG
      ENG -->|"dispatches sources"| TS
      ENG -->|"dispatches sources"| RS
      ENG -->|"dispatches sources"| PY
      SRC -->|"read by"| TS
      SRC -->|"read by"| RS
      SRC -->|"read by"| PY
      TS -->|"emits ir fragment"| IR
      RS -->|"emits ir fragment"| IR
      PY -->|"emits ir fragment"| IR
      ENG -->|"merges + hashes snapshot"| IR
      ENG -->|"runs pipeline over snapshot"| CORE
      CORE -->|"returns candidates + violations"| ENG
      ENG -->|"assembles dto"| OUT
  ```
  --{ ref: 3369eaad-b216-403f-9f85-13a31fb17bb7 }--
