{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81f7-8f5f-d746417a3d11, is_toggleable: true }}
### Data Flow
  {{ ref: c6ea14dc-e5b5-447d-bce5-65de82ba36f8 }}
  ```mermaid
  sequenceDiagram
      box Consumers
      participant CLI as cli / library caller
      end
      box Orchestration
      participant ENG as engine
      end
      box Adapters
      participant AD as language adapters
      end
      box Solver
      participant CORE as core pipeline
      end

      CLI->>ENG: root + config (or pre-built snapshot)
      ENG->>AD: source set, partitioned by language
      Note over AD: parse -> syntax trees<br>bind -> resolved edges + polarity + sloc
      AD->>ENG: ir fragments (confidence-scored edges)
      Note over ENG: merge fragments<br>flatten re-exports<br>blake3 snapshot hash
      ENG->>CORE: immutable snapshot + coefficients
      Note over CORE: condense (tarjan) -> shatter (mfas)<br>layer -> cluster -> pack -> visibility<br>project tests -> score -> diversify
      CORE->>ENG: k candidates per mode + current violations
      Note over ENG: assemble analyze-result dto<br>delta narration vs current tree
      ENG-->>CLI: AnalyzeResult (owned value / json / rendered summary)
  ```
  --{ ref: c6ea14dc-e5b5-447d-bce5-65de82ba36f8 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81f7-8f5f-d746417a3d11 }--

{{ ref: 6f001144-05bb-4e30-ab0c-e8b05684c3b3 }}
- **Between components**: every boundary speaks `ir` types — adapters emit `IrFragment`s; `core` consumes an immutable `Snapshot` and returns owned results; shells see only the `AnalyzeResult` DTO
--{ ref: 6f001144-05bb-4e30-ab0c-e8b05684c3b3 }--
{{ ref: 03a629bf-ee0c-4ceb-bfb5-dfbff92e939a }}
- **Data creation**: snapshots are validated (no dangling edges, well-formed laminar tree) and content-hashed at assembly; invalid input fails fast before any solving
--{ ref: 03a629bf-ee0c-4ceb-bfb5-dfbff92e939a }--
{{ ref: 16206e10-8cae-405a-a040-d79391eeea6b }}
- **Data mutation**: none — every pipeline phase is a pure function from graph views to new owned values; the snapshot is never mutated after hashing
--{ ref: 16206e10-8cae-405a-a040-d79391eeea6b }--
{{ ref: e7ef783d-2fdd-4a72-aeb8-d0c265574aa5 }}
- **Data persistence**: none — library callers and CI wrappers may cache results keyed by the blake3 snapshot hash
--{ ref: e7ef783d-2fdd-4a72-aeb8-d0c265574aa5 }--

