{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8146-870d-df006d773acd }}
## 📚 Tech Stack
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8146-870d-df006d773acd }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-814a-8c12-f1a8a861ee0c, is_toggleable: true }}
### Core Technologies
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8142-91f7-ea5df6011247 }}
  - **Rust** stable 1.85+ — single static binary; performance requirement is explicit (100k-symbol budget)
